('custom-enclosure','Custom Enclosure','PETG',2400,'Enclosures','A snap-fit project enclosure sized and vented to your electronics. We print in durable PETG for chemical and impact resistance, ideal for prototypes, IoT devices, and control boxes.','{"Material":"PETG","Layer height":"0.2mm","Infill":"20% gyroid","Lead time":"3-5 days","Finish":"Matte, sanded seams"}','enclosure',1),
